Package: stanSPsurv
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Split-Population Survival Models with Stan
Version: 0.0.2.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sergio", "Béjar", email = "28761799+Sergio-Bejar@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Bumba", "Mukherjee", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Fits Bayesian split-population survival models with Weibull or
    log-logistic event-time distributions using Stan. Pooled, exchangeable
    group-frailty, and intrinsic conditional autoregressive spatial
    specifications share a common interface. This development version is
    intended for methodological validation before substantive use.
